    },
    "ぐらぐらが多く、ビルが %.1f 度傾いています。頑丈なブロックを足すと、まっすぐに戻ります": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too many wobbly blocks: the building leans %.1f°. Add solid blocks to straighten it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ぐらぐら（%.1f 秒）。ビルが少し傾きます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wobbly (%.1f sec). The building leans a little"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末では動きを読めません。1 回ごとに ＋1 を押してください": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device can't read motion. Tap +1 after each rep"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "この端末では動きを読めません。始めると時計で数えます": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This device can't read motion. Start the timer instead"
